        <untitled-ontology-3:classificacaoPratica>Comum</untitled-ontology-3:classificacaoPratica>
        <untitled-ontology-3:nome>Rastrear mudanças nas dívidas de requisitos</untitled-ontology-3:nome>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#RastrearPropagacaoReD -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#RastrearPropagacaoReD">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#PraticaDivida"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:eParteDe rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#Monitoramento"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:implementadaPor rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#MonitorarInfluenciaReDPartesNaoContemDivida"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:implementadaPor rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#MonitorarProgressoREQ"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:implementadaPor rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#MonitorarPropagacaoReDAtributosQualidade"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:classificacaoPratica>Geral</untitled-ontology-3:classificacaoPratica>
        <untitled-ontology-3:nome>Rastrear a propagação da dívida de requisitos</untitled-ontology-3:nome>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#RealizacaoCasoUso -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#RealizacaoCasoUso">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#ProdutoTrabalhoPratica"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:contem rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#ElementosImplementacaoIdentificados"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:contem rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#InteracaoDefinida"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:contem rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#ResponsabilidadesAlocadas"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:eOrganizadoPor rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#CasoUso"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:eProduzidoPor rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#AnalisarParteCasoUso"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:Icone>&lt;p&gt;Icone Produto de Trabalho&lt;/p&gt;</untitled-ontology-3:Icone>
        <untitled-ontology-3:descricao>&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de casos de uso&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Identificar os elementos do sistema envolvidos no caso de uso.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Capturar as responsabilidades dos elementos do sistema ao executar o caso de uso.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Descrever como os elementos do sistema interagem para executar o caso de uso.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Traduzir a linguagem de neg&amp;oacute;cios usada nas narrativas de casos de uso para a linguagem do desenvolvedor usada para descrever a implementa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do sistema.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Apresenta&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;As realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de casos de uso s&amp;atilde;o extremamente &amp;uacute;teis e podem ser usadas para impulsionar a cria&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e valida&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de muitas das diferentes visualiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es que as equipes usam para projetar e construir seus sistemas. Por exemplo, os designers de interface do usu&amp;aacute;rio usam realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de casos de uso (na forma de storyboards) para explorar o impacto dos casos de uso na interface do usu&amp;aacute;rio. Os arquitetos usam realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de casos de uso para analisar os casos de uso arquitetonicamente significativos e avaliar se a arquitetura &amp;eacute; ou n&amp;atilde;o adequada ao prop&amp;oacute;sito. As realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de casos de uso podem ser apresentadas em muitos formatos diferentes &amp;ndash; o formato da realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o depende completamente das pr&amp;aacute;ticas de desenvolvimento da equipe. Formas comuns de expressar realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de casos de uso incluem tabelas simples, storyboards, diagramas de sequ&amp;ecirc;ncia, diagramas de colabora&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e diagramas de fluxo de dados. O importante &amp;eacute; que a equipe crie uma realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o para identificar quais elementos do sistema est&amp;atilde;o envolvidos na implementa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do caso de uso e como eles ser&amp;atilde;o alterados.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Criar uma realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de caso de uso para cada caso de uso para identificar os elementos do sistema envolvidos na sua execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e, o mais importante, avaliar o quanto eles ter&amp;atilde;o que ser alterados. Voc&amp;ecirc; pode pensar nas realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de casos de uso como fornecendo o &amp;ldquo;como&amp;rdquo; para complementar o &amp;ldquo;o qu&amp;ecirc;&amp;rdquo; da narrativa de casos de uso.&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;A realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de casos de uso &amp;eacute; um produto de trabalho muito flex&amp;iacute;vel; as equipes podem expandir sua realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o para adicionar mais detalhes quando e como precisarem. Se uma equipe pequena estiver fazendo todas as an&amp;aacute;lises e projetos de forma colaborativa, realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es simples e leves de casos de uso ser&amp;atilde;o suficientes. Se uma equipe grande, que n&amp;atilde;o consegue ter muitas sess&amp;otilde;es colaborativas, estiver desenvolvendo um sistema complexo, ent&amp;atilde;o realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es mais detalhadas ajudar&amp;atilde;o na comunica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e garantir&amp;atilde;o que todos os desenvolvedores tenham todas as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es necess&amp;aacute;rias para entregar com sucesso os elementos do sistema e implementar seus fatias de casos de uso.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es adicionais&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: start;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 1.75em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Conte&amp;uacute;do essencial&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;1..N Diagramas ou Tabelas: Diagramas ou tabelas que descrevem a intera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e colabora&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o dos elementos de implementa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: start;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 1.75em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Conte&amp;uacute;do adicional&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;N / D&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</untitled-ontology-3:descricao>
        <untitled-ontology-3:nome>&lt;p&gt;Realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de casos de uso&lt;/p&gt;</untitled-ontology-3:nome>
        <untitled-ontology-3:referenciaRE>&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Refer&amp;ecirc;ncias&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: start;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;sup style=&quot;font-size: smaller;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt; The CRC Card Book, by David Bellin and Susan Suchman Simone, Addison-Wesley, chapter 3-4.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: start;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;sup style=&quot;font-size: smaller;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; The Unified Software Development Process, by Ivar Jacobson, Grady Booch and James Rumbaugh, Addison Wesley Longman, chapter 8-9.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: start;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;sup style=&quot;font-size: smaller;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.extremeprogramming.org/rules/movepeople.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(75, 110, 198);&quot;&gt;www.extremeprogramming.org/rules/movepeople.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: start;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;sup style=&quot;font-size: smaller;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.extremeprogramming.org/rules/crccards.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(75, 110, 198);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;www.extremeprogramming.org/rules/crccards.html&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</untitled-ontology-3:referenciaRE>
        <untitled-ontology-3:sequencia rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">10</untitled-ontology-3:sequencia>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#RealizacaoER -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#RealizacaoER">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#AtividadeProdutoTrabalho"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:produz rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#OrientacoesER"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:produz rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#PadraoOrientacoesRegistroER"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:Icone>&lt;p&gt;Icone Atividade Produto Trabalho&lt;/p&gt;</untitled-ontology-3:Icone>
        <untitled-ontology-3:apresentacao>&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12px;&apos;&gt;Realizar a elicita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de requisitos por meio da t&amp;eacute;cnica selecionada com as fontes de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es definidas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</untitled-ontology-3:apresentacao>
        <untitled-ontology-3:nome>&lt;p&gt;Realizar o treinamento de elicita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de requisitos&lt;/p&gt;</untitled-ontology-3:nome>
        <untitled-ontology-3:sequencia rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">4</untitled-ontology-3:sequencia>
        <untitled-ontology-3:sequenciaAtividadeUC rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">2</untitled-ontology-3:sequenciaAtividadeUC>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#RealizacaoTecnicaER -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#RealizacaoTecnicaER">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#PassosElementosPrática"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:estaContidoEm rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#OrientacoesER"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:descricao>&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;&apos;&gt;Ap&amp;oacute;s as fontes de requisitos e a defini&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da t&amp;eacute;cnica a serem indicadas, a t&amp;eacute;cnica &amp;eacute; desenvolvida e as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es sobre os requisitos s&amp;atilde;o coletadas e registradas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;&apos;&gt;Para registrar as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es, voc&amp;ecirc; pode usar ferramentas de gest&amp;atilde;o de projetos ou ferramentas com suporte para as atividades da engenharia de requisitos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</untitled-ontology-3:descricao>
        <untitled-ontology-3:nome>&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:&apos;Times New Roman&apos;,serif;&quot;&gt;Realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da t&amp;eacute;cnica&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</untitled-ontology-3:nome>
        <untitled-ontology-3:sequenciaAtividadeUC rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">2</untitled-ontology-3:sequenciaAtividadeUC>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#Realizada -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#Realizada">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#PassosElementosPrática"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:estaContidoEm rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#MatrizRastreabilidade"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:descricao>&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;&apos;&gt;A matriz &amp;eacute; preenchida e acompanhada ao longo do desenvolvimento do ciclo de desenvolvimento do software.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;&apos;&gt;Os itens da matriz s&amp;atilde;o observados e gerenciados de acordo com o relacionamento entre eles e as mudan&amp;ccedil;as s&amp;atilde;o analisadas, assim como o seu impacto no ciclo de desenvolvimento de software.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</untitled-ontology-3:descricao>
        <untitled-ontology-3:nome>&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realizada&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</untitled-ontology-3:nome>
        <untitled-ontology-3:sequencia rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">3</untitled-ontology-3:sequencia>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#RealizadoGR -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#RealizadoGR">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#PassosElementosPrática"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:estaContidoEm rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#GrafoRastreabilidade"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:descricao>&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10pt;font-family:&apos;Times New Roman&apos;,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;O grafo &amp;eacute; preenchido e acompanhado ao longo do desenvolvimento do ciclo de desenvolvimento do software.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10pt;font-family:&apos;Times New Roman&apos;,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Os artefatos do grafo s&amp;atilde;o observados e gerenciados de acordo com o relacionamento entre eles e as mudan&amp;ccedil;as s&amp;atilde;o analisadas assim como o seu impacto no ciclo de desenvolvimento de software.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</untitled-ontology-3:descricao>
        <untitled-ontology-3:nome>&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realizado&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</untitled-ontology-3:nome>
        <untitled-ontology-3:sequencia rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">3</untitled-ontology-3:sequencia>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#RealizarCerimonias -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#RealizarCerimonias">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#PraticaDivida"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:implementa rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#ComunicacaoIdentificacao"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:podeMitigar rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#FalhaIdentificacaoRequisitos"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:podeMitigar rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#SistemaGerenciamentoRequisitosAusenteIneficaz"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:podeMitigar rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#ValidacaoRequisitosInexistente"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:classificacaoPratica>Específica</untitled-ontology-3:classificacaoPratica>
        <untitled-ontology-3:descricao>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Recomenda-se realizar cerim&amp;ocirc;nias, as quais est&amp;atilde;o condicionadas &amp;agrave;s: iniciais, sprint planning, p&amp;oacute;s refinamento, reuni&amp;otilde;es di&amp;aacute;rias, conforme a necessidade da organiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ou o m&amp;eacute;todo &amp;aacute;gil adotado.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</untitled-ontology-3:descricao>
        <untitled-ontology-3:nome>Realizar cerimônias</untitled-ontology-3:nome>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#RealizarEstimativaCustoItemReD -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#RealizarEstimativaCustoItemReD">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#PraticaDivida"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:implementa rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#EstimarDTExperiencia"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:classificacaoPratica>Comum</untitled-ontology-3:classificacaoPratica>
        <untitled-ontology-3:descricao>&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Recomenda-se estimar o custo do item da d&amp;iacute;vida de requisitos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</untitled-ontology-3:descricao>
        <untitled-ontology-3:nome>Estimativa de custo do item da dívida de requisitos</untitled-ontology-3:nome>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#RealizarMelhoriasCodigoDesignArquitetura -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#RealizarMelhoriasCodigoDesignArquitetura">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#PraticaDivida"/>
        <untitled-ontology-3:implementa rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/vivid/ontologies/2023/2/untitled-ontology-3#ReestruturacaoCodigoProjeto"/>
